<title>PHILIPPINES: MPC says 9-mth net up 93 percent.</title>
<headline>MPC says 9-mth net up 93 percent.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Metro Pacific Corp said on Thursday it posted a 93 percent jump in its net income in the first nine months of the year to 590.5 million pesos.  </p>
<p>The Philippine flagship of Hong Kong's First Pacific Co said in a statement that earnings per share as of September 30 stood at 18.06 centavos compared with the year-ago 12.03 centavos.</p>
<p>MPC said its consolidated turnover from January to September was up six percent to four billion pesos.</p>
<p>--Manila newsroom (632) 841-89-36, fax 817-62-67</p>
